entities.playback/Keybell.attributes.description.pitch=The pitch of the bell. passed to shader if the bell uses any
entities.playback/Keybell.attributes.description.colour=The color of the bell. passed to shader if the bell uses any
entities.playback/Keybell.attributes.description.activeColour=The color of the bell after correctly hittin the sequence. passed to shader if the bell uses any
entities.playback/Keybell.attributes.description.VolumeBoosta bit of volume to the bell by pretending the player has more speed. Set to 0 for base behaviour. Set to 1 to have all rings act as if the player is at the max speed
entities.playback/Keybell.attributes.description.SetFlag=Sets a flag when the bell is rung. Leave blank to not set a flag
entities.playback/OrderKeybell.attributes.description.Effect=A shader for the bell to be rendered with. 